---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Free Seller Profit Calculator"
  description="Privacy Policy for freesellerprofitcalculator.in — how we protect your information under India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act 2023."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <section class="border-b border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/50 py-10 sm:py-14">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-200">
            Legal &bull; Updated 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500">
          Last Revised: January 1, 2026 &bull; Compliant with Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act 2023
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Policy Content -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-14 space-y-10 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      
      <!-- Summary Box -->
      <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50/60 border border-emerald-200 text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-950">
        <div class="font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
          Privacy-First Architecture Notice
        </div>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Seller Profit Calculator does NOT collect, store, or transmit your financial data.</strong> All calculations (including product selling prices, purchase costs, inventory counts, and profit margins) are computed locally inside your device’s browser using client-side JavaScript. Your commercial trade data never leaves your machine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          1. Introduction
        </h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>Seller Profit Calculator</strong> ("we," "our," or "us"). We operate <code>freesellerprofitcalculator.in</code> (the "Service"). This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of information when you access or use our website.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are committed to respecting your privacy in strict compliance with the <strong>Information Technology Act, 2000</strong>, the <strong>Information Technology (Reasonable Security Practices and Procedures and Sensitive Personal Data or Information) Rules, 2011</strong>, and the <strong>Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act)</strong> of the Republic of India.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          2. Information We Do NOT Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          Unlike conventional accounting or ERP software, our calculators operate on a zero-retention model:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-600">
          <li><strong>No Product or Cost Data:</strong> Numbers you enter into form fields (such as selling price, COGS, category fee rates, shipping fees, or ad spend) are processed strictly in client-side memory.</li>
          <li><strong>No Marketplace Credentials:</strong> We never request, access, or connect to your seller account API keys, passwords, or login portals (Amazon Seller Central, Flipkart Seller Hub, or Meesho Supplier Panel).</li>
          <li><strong>No Bank or Financial Details:</strong> We do not ask for bank account numbers, UPI IDs, credit card details, or GSTINs.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          3. Information We May Automatically Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you browse our website, our web servers may log standard, non-personally identifiable technical information:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-600">
          <li><strong>Log Data:</strong> Internet Protocol (IP) address, browser type and version, operating system, referring URL, time stamp, and pages visited.</li>
          <li><strong>Performance Metrics:</strong> Page loading speeds, script execution errors, and diagnostic metrics used strictly for site stability and security.</li>
          <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> We may use browser <code>localStorage</code> solely to remember your preferred calculator inputs or UI selections on your own device. This data remains on your browser and is never uploaded to our servers.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          4. Information You Voluntarily Provide
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you contact us via our <strong>Contact Us</strong> form or directly by email, we collect only the information you choose to provide (such as your name, email address, seller platform, and message contents). This information is used exclusively to respond to your inquiry, troubleshoot rate card formulas, or improve the tool. We do not sell or lease your contact information to third-party telemarketers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          5. Cookies and Web Analytics
        </h2>
        <p>
          We may use minimal, privacy-friendly first-party cookies and privacy-respecting analytics services to understand aggregated user journeys (for example, identifying which calculators are most popular). You can configure your browser settings to reject cookies; the core calculators will continue to function fully without cookies enabled.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          6. Third-Party Links &amp; Content
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our platform may contain external reference links to official marketplace policies (e.g., Amazon.in, Flipkart.com, CBIC GST portal). We have no control over the privacy practices or content of third-party websites and encourage you to review their respective privacy statements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          7. Data Security
        </h2>
        <p>
          We employ industry-standard Transport Layer Security (TLS/HTTPS) encryption for all network traffic between your web browser and our servers to ensure protection against unauthorized eavesdropping or tampering.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          8. Rights Under DPDP Act 2023
        </h2>
        <p>
          As an Indian citizen and digital user, you are entitled to rights recognized under the DPDP Act 2023, including the right to request access to any personal correspondence we hold, the right to correction of inaccurate contact records, and the right to request deletion of your communication history.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">
          9. Grievance Officer &amp; Contact Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the Information Technology Act 2000 and rules made thereunder, any queries, feedback, or grievances regarding this Privacy Policy may be directed to our Grievance Officer:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 text-xs space-y-1 font-mono">
          <div><strong>Grievance Officer:</strong> Legal &amp; Compliance Lead</div>
          <div><strong>Email:</strong> legal@freesellerprofitcalculator.in</div>
          <div><strong>General Support:</strong> support@freesellerprofitcalculator.in</div>
          <div><strong>Address:</strong> Bengaluru &amp; New Delhi, India</div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
